    "created_at": "2023-01-25T00:17:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-01-25T00:17:25Z",
    "body": "According to https://wicg.github.io/entries-api/#names-paths:\r\n\r\n> A name is a string which:\r\n> does not contain '/' (U+002F SOLIDUS)\r\n> does not contain NUL (U+0000)\r\n> does not contain '\\' (U+005C REVERSE SOLIDUS)\r\n> is not '.' (U+002E FULL STOP)\r\n> is not '..' (U+002E FULL STOP, U+002E FULL STOP)\r\n> A path segment is a [name](https://wicg.github.io/entries-api/#name), '.' (U+002E FULL STOP) or '..' (U+002E FULL STOP, U+002E FULL STOP).",
